  "description": "Meet The One—The Model E/1. A first-of-its-kind pedelec stunningly engineered, clean-cut and extraordinarily responsive is a true statement of modern\ndesign. Imagined, then invented, as a fusion of utility, comfort, power, and handling. Its functionally integrated monoframe and unique layout of internal\ncomponents are a testament of engineering at the highest of standards. The NAILD R3ACT suspension system is a proprietary, market-leading technology\ndesigned to be more efficient when carrying increased weight and travelling at higher speeds over more varied terrain, delivering best-in-class ground contact,\ntraction, and handling. Features the industry-leading Bosch Gen 4 Performance Drive and long-lasting Bosch Powertube 500 Watt-hour battery, paired with the\nlatest Bosch KIOX controller headunit enabled with Bluetooth connectivity.\n\nE/1 Shimano model features the renowned Shimano XT/SLX drivetrain. Featuring 12 gears with responsive lever action, increased efficiency and chain\nmanagement, and improved silence, XT/SLX is an extraordinary, award-winning drivetrain, ensuring riders a safe and comfortable ride.\n\nSo much more than a bicycle, the E/1 is the beginning of a new breed of Personal Mobility Vehicles (PMV) designed for a lifestyle unbound, untethered, and\nuncommon.",
